<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Source-grounded guide to lean-worker's modeled prover protocol, logging proxy, relay rescue source, and pastebin service.">
  <title>Protocols & runtime — lean-worker field guide</title>
